        "@value": "<h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>2025-2026 SEASON LAUNCH PARTY<br /></i></span></strong><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>Arts Education Activity | Art Gallery Tour | Studio Theatre Dance Party</span></b></span></span></h4> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Celebrate the start of Evergreen’s 2025-26 Season of Events! Our special Season Launch Party features an evening of free arts activities.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'> This event is free to attend. Our building is wheelchair accessible with pay parking available on-site and easy access from Lafarge Lake-Douglas Skytrain Station.</span></p> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #008000;'>12 &#8211; 7PM | ART GALLERY AT EVERGREEN OPEN HOURS<br />5PM | EXHIBITION TOUR<br /></span></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>Join the Art Gallery at Evergreen for a walk through our new exhibition from <em>Maya Beaudry: Nesting</em>. Explore the exhibition yourself during gallery hours, or join our curatorial assistant for a guided tour at 5PM.</span></span></p> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #008000;'>5 &#8211; 7PM | ARTS EDUCATION ACTIVITY<br /></span></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Inspired by the artwork of Maya Beaudry, join our educator Cydney Eva for a fun, creative arts activity. Drop in and get creative with soft textures, patterned papers, and trims! This mini collage station invites you to make quick, tactile artworks inspired by colour, pattern, and play. Add your creation to a growing community display—or take it home as a keepsake. No experience needed, just your imagination! &nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #008000;'>7PM | DANCE PARTY WITH THE TOP CITY BAND<br /></span></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>A favourite of Special Event and Festival goers for over three decades, the 11 Piece R&amp;B Band <strong>TOP CITY</strong> performs your favourite R&amp;B, Soul, Motown, Funk, and more. The band features well-known songs by legendary R&amp;B artists, like James Brown, Aretha Franklin &amp; Stevie Wonder etc., and the iconic sounds of the “Great Horn Bands”. Think – Chicago, Tower of Power, Earth Wind and Fire, Powder Blues, and more!</span></p> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong><br />FREE TO ATTEND!</strong><br />Pre-registration is required to attend the Studio Theatre Dance Party.</span></span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong><br /></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
