        "@value": "The Coquitlam Comedy Classic features touring headliners & Canada’s top comics live at Evergreen Cultural Centre. Every previous Jokers Canada event sold out. Lineup subject to change due unforeseen circumstances. Lineup: To be posted on @jokerscanda (Instagram and Facebook)19+ Event | No refundsQuestions? Email: info@jokerscanada.ca This is a rental event organized by Jokers Canada. Share:"
