  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/creative-canadiana-hybrid-camp/var/event_34297_2",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/creative-canadiana-hybrid-camp/var/ri-2.l-L1"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/13.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/creative-canadiana-hybrid-camp/var/ri-2.l-L1"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Creative Canadiana Hybrid Camp"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 18.6667px;'>CREATIVE CANADIANA HYBRID CAMP<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>August 11 &#8211; 15, 2025 | 9AM &#8211; 4PM | $285</span></b></span></p> <p><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Ages: 9 &#8211; 13 | </b></span><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Educators: Julie &amp; Kim</b></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Join us for an exciting and creative adventure at the Creative Canadiana Hybrid Camp! In the morning, explore the world of contemporary Canadian artists and create amazing art inspired by their work. You’ll discover new mediums and techniques, including acrylic painting, watercolour, printmaking, and ceramics, all while learning about the vibrant creativity and styles of different Canadian artists. Let your imagination soar as you experiment with various materials to make your own unique masterpieces!</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>In the afternoon, dive into the world of Canadian music as you work on your very own Mini-Musical, featuring songs by iconic Canadian musicians! You’ll memorize lines, learn group songs, and perfect the music and choreography. The camp will wrap up with a fun, short performance in the Rehearsal Hall, showcasing your hard work and creativity.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>This camp is perfect for young artists who want to explore both visual and performing arts while being inspired by the incredible talent in Canada!</span></p> <p><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>EVERGREEN BOX OFFICE: 604-927-6555</b>&nbsp;</span><br /><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Open Monday – Friday | 12 – 5pm</p> <p></b></span></p> <hr> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div><span style='font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;'><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'>Refund/Withdrawal Policy&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></span></div> <div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>All withdrawals and refund requests must be made 14 days prior to the program start date. </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Withdrawals and refund requests made within 14 days of the program start date may not be eligible for a full refund.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>*Exceptions for medical or compassionate reasons may be considered upon receipt of a written request submitted at least 24 hours prior to the start date of the camp to&nbsp; <span style='color: #339966;'><u><a id='OWAfc9bdbf3-3e41-5310-9014-3dcbfc543b57' class='x_OWAAutoLink' style='color: #339966;' title='mailto:tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' href='mailto:tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' data-linkindex='0' data-outlook-id='a03e9593-efca-44b3-b530-e4f1fc63889e'>tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca</a></u> </span>or <u><a id='OWA6f03482a-574b-781c-add7-6bebcf52aa0b' class='x_OWAAutoLink' style='color: #000000;' title='mailto:boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' href='mailto:boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' data-linkindex='1' data-outlook-id='b635d444-62d6-4bce-bb9c-184d7abbf40b'><span style='color: #339966;'>boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca</span></a></u>. A medical certificate may be required. Upon approval, a refund of the class fee will be granted.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2025-8-13T09:00-7::00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/endDate": [
