    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 18.6667px;'>FASHION FUSION HYBRID CAMP<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>August 25 &#8211; 29, 2025 | 9AM &#8211; 4PM | $285</span></b></span></p> <p><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Ages: 9 &#8211; 13 | </b></span><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Educators: Cyd &amp; Kim</b></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Join fashion designer and visual artist Cyd Eva for a dynamic arts camp where creativity takes centre stage! In the morning, explore the exciting world of colour, patterns, and creative techniques. Learn expressive embroidery and mending as you transform pre-loved clothing like hoodies, sweaters, and jackets with beads, rhinestones, patchwork, and floral designs. Experiment with pattern illustration, colour palettes, and motif creation while working with painting, embroidery, and collage. You&#8217;ll express your unique style through fun hand sewing and decorative techniques, turning textiles and home decor into one-of-a-kind masterpieces!</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>In the afternoon, bring your creativity to life with a Mini-Musical! Memorize lines, learn group songs, and master choreography as you prepare for a short performance in the Rehearsal Hall.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>This camp is perfect for young artists who love to express themselves through fashion, art, and performance—an unforgettable fusion of style and stage!</span></p> <p><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>EVERGREEN BOX OFFICE: 604-927-6555</b>&nbsp;</span><br /><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Open Monday – Friday | 12 – 5pm</p> <p></b></span></p> <hr> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div><span style='font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;'><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'>Refund/Withdrawal Policy&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></span></div> <div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>All withdrawals and refund requests must be made 14 days prior to the program start date. </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Withdrawals and refund requests made within 14 days of the program start date may not be eligible for a full refund.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>*Exceptions for medical or compassionate reasons may be considered upon receipt of a written request submitted at least 24 hours prior to the start date of the camp to&nbsp; <span style='color: #339966;'><u><a id='OWAfc9bdbf3-3e41-5310-9014-3dcbfc543b57' class='x_OWAAutoLink' style='color: #339966;' title='mailto:tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' href='mailto:tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' data-linkindex='0' data-outlook-id='a03e9593-efca-44b3-b530-e4f1fc63889e'>tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca</a></u> </span>or <u><a id='OWA6f03482a-574b-781c-add7-6bebcf52aa0b' class='x_OWAAutoLink' style='color: #000000;' title='mailto:boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' href='mailto:boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' data-linkindex='1' data-outlook-id='b635d444-62d6-4bce-bb9c-184d7abbf40b'><span style='color: #339966;'>boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca</span></a></u>. A medical certificate may be required. Upon approval, a refund of the class fee will be granted.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
