      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Theatrix Drama Studio Camp"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 18.6667px;'>THEATRIX DRAMA STUDIO CAMP<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>August 25 &#8211; 29, 2025 | 9:30AM &#8211; 3:30PM | $285</span></b></span></p> <p><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Ages: 8 &#8211; 12 | w</b></span><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>ith Theatrix</b></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Become a playwright and performer all in one! In this imaginative camp, students will create original characters and scenes, collaborating as a group to build a unique production of their collective works. Guided by a common theme, campers will brainstorm, write, and rehearse their own material, exploring creative storytelling and improvisation along the way. At the end of the week, families and friends will be invited to watch a presentation of original scenes showcasing the campers&#8217; creativity and hard work.</span></p> <p><b style='color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;'>EVERGREEN BOX OFFICE: 604-927-6555</b><span style='color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;'>&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Open Monday – Friday | 12 – 5pm</p> <p></b></span></p> <hr> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div><span style='font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;'><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'>Refund/Withdrawal Policy&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></span></div> <div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>All withdrawals and refund requests must be made 14 days prior to the program start date. </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Withdrawals and refund requests made within 14 days of the program start date may not be eligible for a full refund.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>*Exceptions for medical or compassionate reasons may be considered upon receipt of a written request submitted at least 24 hours prior to the start date of the camp to&nbsp; <span style='color: #339966;'><u><a id='OWAfc9bdbf3-3e41-5310-9014-3dcbfc543b57' class='x_OWAAutoLink' style='color: #339966;' title='mailto:tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' href='mailto:tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' data-linkindex='0' data-outlook-id='a03e9593-efca-44b3-b530-e4f1fc63889e'>tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca</a></u> </span>or <u><a id='OWA6f03482a-574b-781c-add7-6bebcf52aa0b' class='x_OWAAutoLink' style='color: #000000;' title='mailto:boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' href='mailto:boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' data-linkindex='1' data-outlook-id='b635d444-62d6-4bce-bb9c-184d7abbf40b'><span style='color: #339966;'>boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca</span></a></u>. A medical certificate may be required. Upon approval, a refund of the class fee will be granted.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
