        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/olivia-oliver-design-S6-5uIf4LmI-unsplash-scaled.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g7062000"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/fabric-frenzy-half-day-camp/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Fabric Frenzy Half-Day Camp"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>FABRIC FRENZY HALF-DAY CAMP<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>August 25- 29, 2025 | 1:30PM &#8211; 5PM | $175</span></b></span></p> <p><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Ages: 9 &#8211; 13 | </b></span><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Educators: Cyd</b></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Join fashion designer and visual artist Cyd Eva for an exciting arts camp where you&#8217;ll explore colour, patterns, and creative techniques! Learn expressive embroidery and mending as you transform pre-loved clothing like hoodies, sweaters, and jackets with beads, rhinestones, patchwork, and floral designs. Experiment with pattern illustration, colour palettes, and motif creation while working with painting, embroidery, and collage. Express your unique style as you transform textiles and home decor through fun hand sewing and decorative techniques!</span></p> <p><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>EVERGREEN BOX OFFICE: 604-927-6555</b>&nbsp;</span><br /><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Open Monday – Friday | 12 – 5pm</p> <p></b></span></p> <hr> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div><span style='font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;'><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'>Refund/Withdrawal Policy&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></span></div> <div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>All withdrawals and refund requests must be made 14 days prior to the program start date. </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Withdrawals and refund requests made within 14 days of the program start date may not be eligible for a full refund.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>*Exceptions for medical or compassionate reasons may be considered upon receipt of a written request submitted at least 24 hours prior to the start date of the camp to&nbsp; <span style='color: #339966;'><u><a id='OWAfc9bdbf3-3e41-5310-9014-3dcbfc543b57' class='x_OWAAutoLink' style='color: #339966;' title='mailto:tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' href='mailto:tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' data-linkindex='0' data-outlook-id='a03e9593-efca-44b3-b530-e4f1fc63889e'>tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca</a></u> </span>or <u><a id='OWA6f03482a-574b-781c-add7-6bebcf52aa0b' class='x_OWAAutoLink' style='color: #000000;' title='mailto:boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' href='mailto:boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' data-linkindex='1' data-outlook-id='b635d444-62d6-4bce-bb9c-184d7abbf40b'><span style='color: #339966;'>boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca</span></a></u>. A medical certificate may be required. Upon approval, a refund of the class fee will be granted.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
