  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/open-air-2025-hannah-rose/event_34836_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/open-air-2025-hannah-rose/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/IMG_1020-Hannah-Rose-Music.jpeg"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/open-air-2025-hannah-rose/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Open Air Performance Series: Hannah Rose"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 14pt;'><i>HANNAH ROSE<br /> </i></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>Open Air Performance Series<i><br /> </i></span></b></span></span><b><i></i></b></h4> <div class='ewa-rteLine'> <div class='ewa-rteLine'> <div class='ewa-rteLine'> <div class='ewa-rteLine'> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>From&nbsp;<strong>July 7th – August 29th, 2025</strong>&nbsp;join us for a free, 1-hour performance <strong>every Monday to Friday at 6PM</strong> as part of our Open Air Performance Series. By expanding our arts experiences into Town Centre Park, we hope these events will excite our patrons and introduce us to new faces and Lake Lafarge lovers alike. Grab your picnic basket and enjoy a free professional concert in the park!</span></p> <p><i>The Evergreen Cultural Centre Society is supported by Port Coquitlam Community Foundation Theatre Society Legacy Fund.</i></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> </div> </div> <div> <hr> </div> </div> <div> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>ABOUT THE ARTISTS</span></strong></p> </div> <p><span class='TextRun SCXW257108067 BCX0' lang='EN-CA' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;' xml:lang='EN-CA' data-contrast='auto'><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW257108067 BCX0'><strong>Hannah Rose</strong> is a West-Coast based, singer-songwriter specializing in folk, western and country since 2017. Her lyrics are a reflection of family, legacy, growth, love and heartbreak. </span></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span class='TextRun SCXW257108067 BCX0' lang='EN-CA' xml:lang='EN-CA' data-contrast='auto'><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW257108067 BCX0'>Hannah’s writing is inspired by everyday events, and she enjoys finding uniqueness and beauty in the mundane. </span></span><span class='LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW257108067 BCX0'><span class='SCXW257108067 BCX0'>&nbsp;</span></span><span class='TextRun SCXW257108067 BCX0' lang='EN-CA' xml:lang='EN-CA' data-contrast='auto'><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW257108067 BCX0'>Along with Hannah, the band is built up with the amazing talent of local legends Adam Farnsworth @farnsworthmusic (keyboard and backing vocals), Alex Taylor (bass), and Victoria Hartman (fiddle and vocals). </span></span></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span class='TextRun SCXW257108067 BCX0' lang='EN-CA' xml:lang='EN-CA' data-contrast='auto'><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW257108067 BCX0'>Their debut album “Written on a Brown Paper Bag” (2025), was produced at Skeena Street Studios by Adam Farnsworth and Carl Craig. The album is available on bandcamp and soon to be released on all online platforms.</span></span><span class='EOP SCXW257108067 BCX0' data-ccp-props='{}'>&nbsp;</span></span></p> <p><span data-contrast='auto'> </span><span data-ccp-props='{}'>&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-ccp-props='{}'>&nbsp;</span></p> "
      }
    ],
