      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 14pt;'><i>FRUIT PUNCH<br /> </i></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>Open Air Performance Series<i><br /> </i></span></b></span></span><b><i></i></b></h4> <div class='ewa-rteLine'> <div class='ewa-rteLine'> <div class='ewa-rteLine'> <div class='ewa-rteLine'> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>From&nbsp;<strong>July 7th – August 29th, 2025</strong>&nbsp;join us for a free, 1-hour performance <strong>every Monday to Friday at 6PM</strong> as part of our Open Air Performance Series. By expanding our arts experiences into Town Centre Park, we hope these events will excite our patrons and introduce us to new faces and Lake Lafarge lovers alike. Grab your picnic basket and enjoy a free professional concert in the park!</span></p> <p><i>The Evergreen Cultural Centre Society is supported by Port Coquitlam Community Foundation Theatre Society Legacy Fund.</i></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> </div> </div> <div> <hr> </div> </div> <div> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>ABOUT THE ARTISTS</span></strong></p> </div> <p><span class='TextRun SCXW89740525 BCX0' lang='EN-CA' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;' xml:lang='EN-CA' data-contrast='auto'><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW89740525 BCX0'><strong>Fruit Punch</strong> is two high school musicans from the Tri-Cities who have been performing as a duet for a year and a half, and focus on re-inventing classic and alternative rock tunes for a two (wo)man group.</span></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span class='TextRun SCXW89740525 BCX0' lang='EN-CA' xml:lang='EN-CA' data-contrast='auto'><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW89740525 BCX0'>Separately, <strong>Sylvie Jean-Richard</strong> has been performing for 4 years on guitar, and <strong>Cassandra Boratto</strong> has been performing for 4 years on voice and guitar. They have performed with bands together in front of over 1500 people and both as a duet for </span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW89740525 BCX0'>special events</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW89740525 BCX0'> at their school. Cassandra Boratto performed at Evergreen Culture Center October of 2024, opening with Sal McGregor for Bill Henderson (</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW89740525 BCX0'>front man</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW89740525 BCX0'> of Chilliwack), Steven McClintock, and Evan Hunter during VIMBC. Both are looking to pursue a career in the music industry with Cassandra attending UVIC this coming fall, and Sylvie hoping to attend UBC for clarinet in 2 years.</span></span><span class='EOP SCXW89740525 BCX0' data-ccp-props='{}'>&nbsp;</span></span></p> <p><span data-contrast='auto'> </span><span data-ccp-props='{}'>&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-ccp-props='{}'>&nbsp;</span></p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
