  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/pswe-cityscapes/event_34711_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/pswe-cityscapes/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/3-4.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g8245800"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/pswe-cityscapes/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Pacific Symphonic Wind Ensemble: Cityscapes"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>CITYSCAPES<br /></i>Pacific Symphonic Wind Ensemble<br /></span></strong></h4> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ABOUT THE SHOW<br /></strong>Since around 56% of the world&#8217;s population lives in urban environments, why not take a walk with PSWE through some of the many fascinating locales? Both historical and, perhaps, mythical will be explored in this classical programme. Directed by <strong>Christin Reardon-McLellan</strong>.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ABOUT THE ARTIST<br /></strong>The <strong>Pacific Symphonic Wind Ensemble</strong> is a 45 piece band made up of highly skilled musicians in the Lower Mainland of Vancouver, BC. PSWE aspires to present the best performances of modern wind band music through our regular four concert season. Formed in 1981 by Maurice Backun, and currently conducted by Music Director&nbsp;<strong><span class='wixui-rich-text__text'><a class='wixui-rich-text__text' style='color: #000000;' href='https://www.pacificsymphonicwindensemble.com/david-branter-director' target='_self' rel='noopener'>David Branter</a></span></strong>, PSWE is&nbsp;based in the Metro Vancouver region of British Columbia.&nbsp;The Pacific Symphonic Wind Ensemble boasts many of the area’s finest wind and percussion musicians. The group consists of professional musicians, dedicated music educators, and outstanding amateur players. &nbsp;From its inception, PSWE has worked with composers, conductors and soloists to perform new and unusual works, in addition to classics of the wind ensemble repertoire. PSWE has become internationally known for its musical excellence.</span></p> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div>&nbsp;</div> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults: $30 | Seniors: $20 | Under 12: $12</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><em>This is a co-presentation organized by Pacific Symphonic Wind Ensemble.</em></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2025-11-8T19:30-7::00"
