  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/miraculous-journey/event_35050_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/miraculous-journey/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Edward-1080x1080-gvpta.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g8413940"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/miraculous-journey/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Miraculous Journey of Edward Tulane"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='color: #000000;'><strong><span style='font-size: 18.6667px;'><i>THE MIRACULOUS JOURNEY OF EDWARD TULANE</i><br /></span><span style='font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;'>Presented by Royal Canadian Theatre Company</span></strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-size: 14pt;'><strong><span style='color: #000000;'>Adapted by Dwayne Hartford</span></strong></span></span><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;'><strong><span style='color: #000000;'>From the book by Kate DiCamillo</span></strong></span></p> <p class='elementToProof'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>How long does it take to learn to love?<br /></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>This show for all ages is heartwarming and poetic. Follow the journey&nbsp; of a vain porcelain rabbit named <i>Edward Tulane</i>&nbsp;who learns the true meaning of love through loss, hardship, and transformation. Edward begins an extraordinary journey across years and landscapes, passing through the hands of various owners.&nbsp; Is love worth the risk? And how long does is take to learn to love?</span></p> <p class='elementToProof'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>RCTC is proud to present a <b><i>Relaxed Performance </i></b>for &#8220;The Miraculous Journey of Edward Tulane&#8221; on Saturday March 21st at 7:30pm. Sometimes called “sensory friendly performances”, these performances are designed to make theatre more welcoming for audience members who live with autism spectrum disorder, sensory, communication or other intellectual challenges. <b><i>Relaxed Performances</i></b>&nbsp;are also excellent for anyone with babes in arms or toddlers. What to expect during a <b><i>Relaxed Performance</i></b>:</span></p> <ul> <li> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Sound and lighting cues are adjusted to be less intense;</span></p> </li> <li> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>exiting and entering the auditorium is allowed at any time;</span></p> </li> <li> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>auditorium lights are never fully turned off;</span></p> </li> <li> <p class='elementToProof' role='presentation'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>audience noise, movement and even the use of phones or other “fidget devices” are tolerated.</span></p> </li> </ul> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE:</strong><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults: $38.25 | Seniors &amp; Students: $33.25<br />Discounts available for a family of four and groups of 10 or more by calling the Box Office.</span><br /></span></span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><em>This is a rental event organized by Royal Canadian Theatre Company.</em></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
