      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><strong><span style='color: #000000;'>ADULT IMPROV &amp; ACTING: CHARACTER DEVELOPMENT<br /></span></strong><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>with Educator Michael Charrois</span></b></span></span></h4> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Join Arts Educator, Michael Charrois, for an evening of improv &amp; acting. This course will take you through the fundamental techniques of Narrative Improv, which essentially involves spontaneous storytelling in a play format. It is commonly presented in a specific style and delves into both comedic and emotional aspects. Narrative improv performances typically have a longer duration compared to short-form or long-form improv, allowing for a more extensive exploration of various feelings and themes.<br /></span></p> <h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>CLASS INFORMATION&nbsp;<br /></strong></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'>December 2 &#8211; 16, 2025 | 6:30PM &#8211; 8:30PM<br />$85 per person | Age 18+</span></span></h4> <hr> <h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ABOUT OUR EDUCATOR</strong></span></h4> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Michael Charrois is a professional actor (UBCP/Actra and Equity) with over 30 years of teaching experience. He currently teaches Drama classes for the Evergreen, Burnaby&#8217;s Shadbolt Centre Community Programs and has taught Continuing Education classes for the Vancouver School Board.</span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong><br /></strong></span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>REGISTER ONLINE OR AT THE BOX OFFICE:</strong><br /></span></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
