        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>ADULT CERAMICS: WHAT WE MAKE OF IT<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>with Julie Epp</span><br /></b></span></span></h4> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Join art educator Julie Epp for an engaging guided tour and in-depth exploration of the current exhibition at the Art Gallery at Evergreen. Following this reflective experience, return to the studio to create your own expressive ceramic artwork using hand building techniques. Draw inspiration from the themes, emotions, and artistic practices encountered in the gallery to inform your creative process and personal response.</span></p> <h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>CLASS INFORMATION&nbsp;<br /></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>September 23, November 4, December 9 | 6:30PM<br />$55/person per workshop, Age 18+</p> <p></span></h4> <hr> <h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ABOUT OUR EDUCATOR<br /></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Julie is a visual artist who works in painting, sculpture, and mixed media to explore themes of beauty, nature, and the human experience. Julie Epp is an award-winning artist from Abbotsford, BC and holds a BFA from the University of the Fraser Valley. She has exhibited&nbsp;throughout BC and teaches art to children and adults throughout the lower mainland.&nbsp;</span></h4> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>REGISTER ONLINE OR AT THE BOX OFFICE:</strong><br /></span></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong> 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
