      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>ADULT BEGINNER VOICE OVER ACTING<br /></i></span></strong><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>with Educator Pamela Hammond</span><br /></b></span></span></h4> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Learn the basics of voice over work, script editing, vocal dynamics, pacing and breath control, how to create and market a voice demo, script terminology and invoicing, multi-person script reads, creating characters, and home studio recording requirements. Students are required to work outside comfort zones reading aloud on a microphone. This is a fun class for those who want to get into the voice over industry or those who just want to get out and meet new people.&nbsp;</span></p> <h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>CLASS INFORMATION&nbsp;<br /></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Mondays at 6:15PM | $165.00 per person<br /></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'>September 22 &#8211; November 3, 2025 (No class October 13)</span></span></span></h4> <hr> <h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ABOUT OUR EDUCATOR<br /></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>In 1998 Pamela got her start in voice acting by chance, voicing a short commercial for Global TV. Since then, she has voiced Internationally for TV &amp; Radio Commercials, Animation&nbsp;&amp; Gaming, Jingles, Narration &amp; Documentaries, Corporate Presentations, E-Learning, Social Media Ads and On Hold Messaging. In addition to voice acting, she has also produced spots with a few co-writing credits.<br /></span></h4> <h4><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>REGISTER ONLINE OR AT THE BOX OFFICE:</strong><br /></span></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM<br /></strong><strong><br /></strong></span></h4> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
