  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/creative-explorations-adult-camp/event_34302_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/creative-explorations-adult-camp/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/6.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g8780920"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/creative-explorations-adult-camp/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "CANCELLED | Creative Explorations Adult Art Camp"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>CANCELLED | CREATIVE EXPLORATIONS ADULT ART CAMP<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>August 18 &#8211; 22, 2025 | 6PM &#8211; 8:30PM | $180</span></b></span></p> <p><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Ages 18+ | </b></span><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Educators: Julie</b></span></p> <p><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #ff0000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'>Unfortunately, this event has been cancelled.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Join us for a Creative Explorations, an adult art camp where you’ll have the opportunity to dive into a wide range of art forms and techniques! This camp offers a hands-on experience with a variety of mediums, including ceramics, printmaking, watercolour, and acrylic painting. You’ll explore the fundamentals of landscape painting, portraiture, and other exciting subjects, while learning different techniques to bring your ideas to life.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Whether you&#8217;re experimenting with clay to create stunning sculptures, using watercolours to capture the beauty of nature, or painting vibrant acrylic pieces, this camp will encourage you to push your creative boundaries. It&#8217;s the perfect place for aspiring artists to experiment, refine their skills, and discover new ways to express their artistic vision.</span></p> <p><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>EVERGREEN BOX OFFICE: 604-927-6555</b>&nbsp;</span><br /><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Open Monday – Friday | 12 – 5pm</p> <p></b></span></p> <hr> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div><span style='font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;'><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'>Refund/Withdrawal Policy&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></span></div> <div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>All withdrawals and refund requests must be made 14 days prior to the program start date. </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Withdrawals and refund requests made within 14 days of the program start date may not be eligible for a full refund.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>*Exceptions for medical or compassionate reasons may be considered upon receipt of a written request submitted at least 24 hours prior to the start date of the camp to&nbsp; <span style='color: #339966;'><u><a id='OWAfc9bdbf3-3e41-5310-9014-3dcbfc543b57' class='x_OWAAutoLink' style='color: #339966;' title='mailto:tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' href='mailto:tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' data-linkindex='0' data-outlook-id='a03e9593-efca-44b3-b530-e4f1fc63889e'>tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca</a></u> </span>or <u><a id='OWA6f03482a-574b-781c-add7-6bebcf52aa0b' class='x_OWAAutoLink' style='color: #000000;' title='mailto:boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' href='mailto:boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' data-linkindex='1' data-outlook-id='b635d444-62d6-4bce-bb9c-184d7abbf40b'><span style='color: #339966;'>boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca</span></a></u>. A medical certificate may be required. Upon approval, a refund of the class fee will be granted.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2025-8-18T18:00-7::00"
      }
    ],
