  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/family-days-september-2025/event_35114_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/family-days-september-2025/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Family-Days_FB-Event.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g8818560"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/family-days-september-2025/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Family Days"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div class='et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light'> <p class='et_pb_text_inner'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='font-size: 14pt;'><strong>FAMILY DAYS<br /> <span style='font-size: 12pt;'>at the Art Gallery at Evergreen</span></strong></span></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Inspired by our current public art exhibitions.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Join us for a creative, hands-on Family Day activity that draws inspiration from the public art surrounding Evergreen Cultural Centre. Together, we&#8217;ll explore art in unexpected places and make something special to take home. All ages welcome—let your imagination lead the way!</span></p> </div> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>12PM + 2PM |&nbsp; Pre-Registration Required</strong></span></p> <hr> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>ABOUT THE CURRENT GALLERY EXHIBITION</b></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>How do stories transform the present and project the future? How do we relate to ourselves and the world around us? Looking to the stars and tracing the constellations offers a reminder of the expansiveness of time and the stories that situate us within the vastness of the universe.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><em>Multitudes</em> is a group exhibition featuring work from Sonny Assu, Chun Hua Catherine Dong, Deborah Edmeades, Odera Igbokwe, Cheyenne Rain LeGrande ᑭᒥᐊᐧᐣ and Tatjana Mirkov-Popovicki. Drawing from the fantastical, these artists explore layers of identity as they traverse the present, untangle oppressive histories and imagine the future (and the self) as sites of renewal. Working across sculpture, painting, textiles, new media and video, the artists draw inspiration from fantasy, the influence of technology and stories of the cosmos that shape our experiences of the present.</span></p> "
      }
    ],
