        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>BALLET BC: ANNEX<br /></i></span></strong></h4> <div class='ewa-rteLine'> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>Ballet BC Annex</strong> is a project led by Canada&#8217;s leading contemporary dance company, Ballet BC. Based in Vancouver, the program offers an invaluable opportunity for schools and communities across BC to engage in world-class dance and educational programming. Each season, a junior company of Annex dancers training with Modus Operandi and Arts Umbrella Dance tour throughout the Lower Mainland and across BC, bringing contemporary dance repertoire and professional performances to audiences of all ages.</span></p> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'> In the 2025/26 season, Ballet BC Annex will share two new dance creations by acclaimed Vancouver-based choreographers Alexis Fletcher and Vanessa Goodman. In schools, insightful workshops and Q&amp;A sessions led by dancers and Ballet BC’s Education and Engagement team will accompany each performance, offering a closer look into the choreographic process and the career path of a dancer. Students learn excerpts from the performance and engage in creative dialogue.</span></p> </div> <div class='ewa-rteLine'>&nbsp;</div> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE JULY 01!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults: $43 | Seniors: $39 | Students: $16</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
