    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>NORMAN FOOTE &amp; THE HOWL MUSICAL MASQUERADE</i><br /></span></strong></h4> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Wonderful songs, an animated choir of howlers and Norman’s engaging connection with the audience make this concert a Halloween treat for all. Everyone gets into the spirit of this colourful tradition. Light-heartedness and creative costumes are welcome. Norman Foote is originally from Squamish and lives in North Vancouver. </span></p> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>He’s travelled throughout the world with his special brand of music and comedy. His musicality is like no other, mixing clever hooks, witty wordplay and humour to great effect. His accolades include a Juno, four WCMA awards, Parents&#8217; Choice gold awards, and others. He spreads joy and creativity through his songs, stories and innovative props. This year, Norman released his 10th album called “Shoe-fly.” &nbsp; </span></p> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Joining Norman will be singers from Coastal Sound, Blakeburn School and Fairview School.</span></p> <div class='ewa-rteLine'>&nbsp;</div> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults &amp; Seniors: $30 | Students: $16</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
