        "@value": "CANCELLED | Kinder Chorus"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 12pt;'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: #ff0000;'>CANCELLED | KINDER CHORUS</span><br />with the Vancouver Symphony Orchestra School of Music<br /></span></b></span></span></h4> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #ff0000;'>Unfortunately, this class has been cancelled.</span></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>The VSO School of Music Children&#8217;s Vocal Program introduces young children to the joy of singing through play-based learning, fostering vocal exploration, musicianship, and creative expression across three progressive levels. Starting with basic sound-making and movement in Kinder Chorus, to note-reading and songwriting in Crescendo Chorus, and culminating in the high-energy performance-focused Young Singers Show Choir, the program builds foundational musical skills while encouraging confidence and fun.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>Kinder Chorus</strong> introduces young children to the joys of singing through a play-based approach, focusing on vocal exploration, beginner musicianship, and fun singing games. Students develop foundational skills like understanding pitch, volume, and sound-making techniques, all while engaging in visual patterns and simple breathing exercises.</span></p> <h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>CLASS INFORMATION: <br /></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>Dates: </strong>Thursdays at 3PM | September 25 &#8211; December 11, 2025<br /><strong>Cost:&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'>$298<br /><strong>Age:</strong> 4 &#8211; 5 Years</span></span></span></h4> <hr> <h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong><br />ABOUT THE VSO SCHOOL OF MUSIC<br /></strong></span><span style='color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'>VSO School of Music, founded in 2010, is a 25,000 square foot state of-the-art music school located adjacent to the Orpheum Theatre in downtown Vancouver. With a mission to enrich lives through the joy of learning, playing and performing the world’s great music, the VSO SoM develops experiences that are accessible to all, regardless of age, ability, playing level or economic circumstances; and by nurturing creative and engaged members of society through achievement in the musical arts at the downtown and satellite locations. With a roster of over 1900 students, the School is proud to offer individual or group instruction by members of the Vancouver Symphony and other high-quality music educators.&nbsp;</span><span style='color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'>The school also features a performance theatre (Pyatt Hall) and Reception space which sees a wide range of arts, entertainment, and corporate groups utilizing the space for performances, recordings, and special events. </span></h4> <div><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>REGISTER ONLINE OR AT THE BOX OFFICE:&nbsp;</strong><br /></span></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM<br /></strong><strong><br /></strong></span></div> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
