  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/art-studio-happy-hour/event_35073_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/art-studio-happy-hour/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Screenshot-2025-09-09-165611-1.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g9371640"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/art-studio-happy-hour/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Art Studio Happy Hour"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='color: #000000;'><b><i>ART STUDIO HAPPY HOUR</i><br /></b></span></span></h4> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Unwind, sip, and get inspired. Join us for Art Studio Happy Hour—a relaxed, social arts program where creativity meets community. Whether you&#8217;re a total beginner or a seasoned maker, our rotating workshops offer a chance to explore new art skills while enjoying a glass of wine in good company. Each session focuses on a different craft—ranging from painting and sewing to printmaking—guided by talented local instructors in a welcoming, judgment-free space. All materials are provided, and no prior experience is necessary.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Perfect for a night out with friends, a creative solo escape, or a unique date idea. Come for the wine, stay for the art.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong><span style='color: #ff0000;'>CANCELLED</span> Oct 3 | Fashion Remix : Painting on Denim/Clothing<br /></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='color: #ff0000;'>The October 3 session has unfortunately been cancelled.</span><br />Turn your old denim or clothing into a wearable work of art! In this playful, hands-on workshop, you’ll learn techniques for painting on fabric—think bold patterns, expressive brushstrokes, and personalized designs that reflect your unique style. Remix your wardrobe using textile paints, stencils, and your imagination. Bring your own denim jacket, jeans, or t-shirt—or use one of our fabric samples to experiment. No experience needed—just a love of colour, creativity, and fashion that makes a statement!</span></p> <p class='p1'><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='color: #ff0000;'>CANCELLED</span> Oct 24 | Wearable Repairs : Embroidery &amp; Mending on Clothing<br /></span></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='color: #ff0000;'>The October 24 session has unfortunately been cancelled.</span></span><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><br /></span></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Celebrate the beauty of imperfection by transforming worn or damaged clothing into something artful and new. In this hands-on workshop, you&#8217;ll learn visible mending and simple embroidery techniques to repair, embellish, and personalize your garments. Stitch with intention, add texture and colour, and turn flaws into features. Bring a beloved piece in need of care—or start fresh with fabric samples provided. No experience necessary—just a willingness to slow down, stitch, and reconnect with your clothes.</span></p> <p class='p1'><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Nov 14 | Rhythms in Colour : Abstract Pattern Painting on Canvas</span></strong><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Explore the expressive power of pattern, repetition, and vibrant colour in this abstract painting workshop. Inspired by rhythm and movement, you’ll experiment with layering shapes, lines, and textures to create dynamic compositions on canvas. Play with intuition, balance, and bold design as you develop your own visual language. No experience needed—just a curiosity for colour and a willingness to paint outside the lines.&nbsp;</span></p> <hr> <h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>CLASS INFORMATION&nbsp;<br /></strong>Fridays at 6:30PM<br /></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>$55 per person/class | Age 18+</p> <p></span></h4> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>REGISTER ONLINE OR AT THE BOX OFFICE:</strong><br /></span></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM<br /></strong><strong><br /></strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
