    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Stage 43: Legally Blonde - The Musical"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>LEGALLY BLONDE: THE MUSICAL<br /></i><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>Presented by Stage 43</span><br /></span></strong><span style='font-size: 12pt;'><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'>Book by Heather Hach<br /></span></strong><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'>Music and Lyrics by Laurence &#8220;Larry&#8221; O&#8217;Keefe, Nell Benjamin</span></strong></span></h4> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ABOUT THE SHOW<br /></strong>The famously perky Elle Woods, a fashion-savvy, UCLA sorority girl finds her life turned upside down when dumped by her boyfriend Warner. In an effort to prove to Warner that she is more than just some blonde sorority girl, she follows him to Harvard Law, where she struggles to fit in and do well. Ultimately, she defies expectations and manages to stay true to her delightfully pink personality!<br /></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ABOUT THE ARTIST<br /></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>Stage 43</strong>&nbsp;is a community theatre group that has been producing quality, affordable theatre in the Tri-Cities since 1983. Every year, Stage43 produces three shows at Evergreen. Stage 43 is part of the&nbsp;<a style='color: #000000;' href='https://theatrebc.org/fraser-valley-zone/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'><strong>Theatre BC Fraser Valley Zone</strong></a>&nbsp;and a member of the&nbsp;<a style='color: #000000;' href='https://www.facebook.com/groups/133888206632951/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'><strong>Community Theatre Coalition</strong></a>.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Stage 43 is proud to call Evergreen Cultural Centre their home theatre, and continues to make community connections a priority.</span></p> <div>&nbsp;</div> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults: $30 | Seniors: $25 | Students: $25</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><em>This is a co-presentation organized by Stage 43 Theatrical Society.</em></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
