  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/tiny-spark-student-recital-dec-2025/event_35346_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/tiny-spark-student-recital-dec-2025/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/tiny-spark-student-recital-dec-2025/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g9618000"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/tiny-spark-student-recital-dec-2025/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Tiny Spark Student Recital"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h3 class='mb-0'><span style='font-size: 14pt;'><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'>TINY SPARK STUDENT RECITAL</span></strong></span></h3> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>The Tiny Spark Student Recital is a live show featuring student performers. Tiny Spark welcomes K-12 students of all levels and styles. Registration and participation is free for performers.</span><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>​</span><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Tony Spark aims to create a positive, supportive and accessible platform for students to showcase their skills. We hope to cultivate in young artists a sense of community and connection through performance.​</span></p> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>ABOUT TINY SPARK</span></strong></p> <p class='font_7 wixui-rich-text__text'><span class='wixui-rich-text__text' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>As educators and parents, we recognize that there are very few opportunities for students to perform solo or in small groups for live audiences.&nbsp; Most performance opportunities either require travel, are costly, or are competitive. &nbsp;</span></p> <p class='font_7 wixui-rich-text__text'><span class='wixui-rich-text__text' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>The Tiny Spark Student Recital is built on the idea that performing arts such as music and dance are meant to be celebrated and shared. &nbsp;To truly benefit from learning performing arts, students need to experience the joy of connecting with a live audience. &nbsp;This recital was created to give all students, regardless of background, an accessible platform with which to share their talents.</span></p> <p class='font_7 wixui-rich-text__text'><span class='wixui-rich-text__text' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Our mission is to inspire, to build confidence, and to cultivate a sense of community in the next generation of artists.&nbsp;</span></p> <hr> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>TICKETS ON SALE!</span></strong><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>All tickets just $20!<br /></span><em>This is a rental event organized by Tiny Spark.</em></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
