  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/badass-babes-jungle/event_35291_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/badass-babes-jungle/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Bad-Ass-Babes-Jungle-scaled.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g9627060"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/organizer": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g9627100"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/badass-babes-jungle/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Badass Babes: Welcome to the Jungle"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><strong><span style='font-size: 18.6667px;'><i>WELCOME TO THE JUNGLE<br /></i></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>Badass Babes Dance</span></strong></span></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Step into the wild with us for &#8220;Welcome to the Jungle&#8221;&nbsp;— a fierce, empowering, and unforgettable night of DANCE!</span></p> <p class='elementToProof'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Presented by Badass Babes Dance, an all-adult dance company rooted in <i>confidence, community, and self-expression</i>, this showcase celebrates more than just choreography — it’s a reflection of growth, courage, and transformation.</span></p> <p class='elementToProof'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Our dancers have spent months strengthening their mental, emotional, and physical well-being, and this night is their moment to shine. Expect a mix of high-energy routines&nbsp;that will have you dancing in your seat and slow, sensual moments&nbsp;that captivate and connect.</span></p> <ul> <li><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Hosted by Chelsea Seward</span></li> <li><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Live Music by Dj Physik</span></li> <li><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>50/50, raffle and giveaways</span></li> <li><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Pre-sale clothing order</span></li> <li><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Special guest performers</span></li> <li><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Bar service available</span></li> <li><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Grab some professional footage with our photographers and videographer!</span></li> </ul> <p class='elementToProof'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>✨&nbsp;Money raised from the 50/50 and raffle sales will be going to the <a style='color: #000000;' title='https://www.mrpmchristmashamper.org/' href='https://www.mrpmchristmashamper.org/' target='_blank' rel='noopener' data-outlook-id='0a9a741a-3e7e-444c-b5f9-4a31538ca650'><span style='text-decoration: underline;'><span style='color: #008000; text-decoration: underline;'>Maple Ridge Christmas Hamper</span></span></a>, helping families celebrate the holidays with a little more ease, and a lot more joy.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>✨ We will also have a box to collect items for <span style='text-decoration: underline;'><span style='color: #008000; text-decoration: underline;'><a style='color: #008000; text-decoration: underline;' title='https://www.coastmentalhealth.com/the-hub-a-safe-place-in-maple-ridge/' href='https://www.coastmentalhealth.com/the-hub-a-safe-place-in-maple-ridge/' target='_blank' rel='noopener' data-outlook-id='267e9913-59d9-4239-b586-0b971074c6e4'>The Hub</a> in Maple Ridge: rResource</span></span> for people facing homelessness and poverty. </span><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>&#8211; Gently used sleeping bags, throw blankets, winter clothes, gloves</span><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>&#8211; New packs of socks and underwear.</span><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>&#8211; Gently used mens pants size 28 &#8211; 34 desperately needed.</span></p> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>ABOUT BADASS BABES DANCE<br /></span></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Badass Babes Dance is an all-adult dance training company dedicated to empowering, inspiring, and educating dancers of every skill level, body type, and background. Built on a foundation of inclusivity and support, we create a safe space where women can grow physically, mentally, and emotionally. Our high-energy classes and performances are designed to uplift and unite—celebrating the joy of movement while making a meaningful impact. Through our showcases, we dance with purpose—raising funds, building community, and welcoming YOU to join the experience!</span></p> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE:</strong><br />$30-$50<br /></span></span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><em>This is a rental event organized by Badass Babes Dance.</em></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
