        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "2025 Coquitlam Christmas Night Market"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;'><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><strong>2025 COQUITLAM CHRISTMAS NIGHT MARKET</strong></span></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>The Coquitlam Christmas Night Market is a three night annual family holiday tradition. This is where shopping meets food, meets fun, and to cap off the night, enjoy the Lights at Lafarge.</p> <p>Get your last minute presents for the “hard to shop” for family and friends. We will have unique and handmade vendors to finish off your shopping list. We will have food vendors to tantalize your taste buds, so come join us for all 3 nights! </span></p> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>TICKETS ONLY AVAILABLE AT THE DOOR!</strong><br />Entry just $2, cash or e-transfer only.<br /></span></span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><em>This is a rental event organized by Betty Bakes.</em></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
