0000;'>And just like Life, if you accept, advance and overcome obstacles, there&#8217;s no telling where improvisation takes you, but if you block and say &#8220;No&#8221; the story goes nowhere. We will play games for Character and Narrative and learn scenarios to hang the improvisation on. No memorization required, just a willingness to say &#8220;Yes!&#8221; and have fun.&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>CLASS INFORMATION&nbsp;</p> <p></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Tuesday Evenings, January 13 &#8211; 27 | 6:30 &#8211; 8:30PM<br /></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>$85/person<br />Age 18+</span></p> <hr> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ABOUT OUR EDUCATOR</p> <p></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Michael Charrois is a professional actor (UBCP/Actra and Equity) with over 30 years of teaching experience. He currently teaches Drama classes for the Evergreen, Burnaby&#8217;s Shadbolt Centre Community Programs and has taught Continuing Education classes for the Vancouver School Board.</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>REGISTER ONLINE OR AT THE BOX OFFICE:</strong><br /></span></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong> 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
