  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/adult-intro-to-voice-over-spring-2026/event_35430_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/adult-intro-to-voice-over-spring-2026/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/1.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g9795120"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/adult-intro-to-voice-over-spring-2026/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Adult Intro to Voice Over Acting"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 18.6667px;'>ADULT INTRO TO VOICE OVER ACTING<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>with Pamela Hammond</span><br /></b></span></span></h4> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Explore the exciting world of voice over, from commercials and audiobooks to e-learning and character work. Gain hands-on mic experience, script editing skills, and techniques for sounding natural and engaging. Learn industry essentials like demo requirements, client outreach, invoicing, and home studio setup. Advanced classes build on timing, cold reads, and delivering varied takes for professional work. Ideal for aspiring voice actors or anyone curious to try something new—no singing required!</p> <p></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>This course is meant for those with little or no experience in the Voice Over Industry.</span></span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>You will learn about various Voice Over career paths including TV &amp; Radio Commercials, E-Learning, On Hold Messaging, Creating Characters and Audio Books. Learn requirements for Voice Over Demos, Where To Look For Work, How To Contact Clients, Script Editing &amp; Using the appropriate emotions, Invoicing and Pay Rates and Requirements for setting up a home recording studio. This course includes both lecture and hands on so you must be able to work outside of your comfort zone on the mic. 2 Person voice acting will be included in the 5th class. Microphone and breathing techniques will also be covered as well as how to sound more conversational and personable.</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>This is a fun class for those who want to get into the voice over industry or those who just want to get out and meet new people.&nbsp;</p> <p></span></p> <p class='p1'><strong style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>CLASS INFORMATION&nbsp;</p> <p></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Monday Evenings, February 9 &#8211; March 23 (no class February 19) | 6:15 &#8211; 9:15PM<br /></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>$165/person<br />Age 18+</span></p> <hr> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ABOUT OUR EDUCATOR</p> <p></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>In 1998 Pamela got her start in voice acting by chance, voicing a short commercial for Global TV. Since then, she has voiced Internationally for TV &amp; Radio Commercials, Animation&nbsp;&amp; Gaming, Jingles, Narration &amp; Documentaries, Corporate Presentations, E-Learning, Social Media Ads and On Hold Messaging. In addition to voice acting, she has also produced spots with a few co-writing credits.</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>REGISTER ONLINE OR AT THE BOX OFFICE:</strong><br /></span></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong> 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
