  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/rhs-fistful-of-kicks/event_34698_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/rhs-fistful-of-kicks/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/SHOW-IMAGE-TEXT-1920x1080-1.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g10250540"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/rhs-fistful-of-kicks/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Rehearsal Hall Sessions: Fistful of Kicks - Intergenerational Family Dramedy"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>INTERGENERATIONAL FAMILY DRAMEDY<br /></i>Fistful of Kicks</span></strong></h4> <p><span style='color: #000000;'><span style='color: #000000;'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>ABOUT THE SHOW<br /></strong></span></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>The best way to de-stress after the holidays? An <em>Intergenerational Family Dramedy</em>, of course! It’s all of the Family Drama you could ever want, improvised entirely on the spot. And the best part of all? It’s not your family’s drama you’re watching.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Get ready to be whisked away into the world of a dysfunctional East Asian family created entirely on the spot and inspired by you, the audience.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>This show has it all. Gratuitous family drama? Check. Rip-roaring comedy? Check. Sibling rivalries? Check. A sense of struggle to find your place in the world as a second-generation immigrant? Check. Unending rivers of gossip unleashed faster than your shocked self can yell “Auntie! SHH!!”? Check, check, triple-check.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Take a break from the real world and come see us explore the relationships, tensions, cultural expectations, alliances, and treachery of a multigenerational Asian family as they navigate generational boundaries and the modern world. And the best part of it all? It’s not your family’s drama that you’re watching. So kick back, relax, and enjoy all of the juiciest and funniest parts of Asian family drama brought to life on stage by Fistful of Kicks.</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000;'><span style='color: #000000;'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>ABOUT THE ARTIST<br />Fistful of Kicks</strong> has been creating comedy magic all around Vancouver and the world since 2017. They’ve performed at festivals all over North America, including Calgary, Seattle, Portland, and Austin, and are a mainstay at the Vancouver Improv Festival and Just for Laughs: Vancouver, in addition to producing sketch comedy for CBC. </span></span></span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000;'><span style='color: #000000;'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>They bring their unique wit and shared cultural heritage, to every show they’ve developed and produced, including improv based on East Asian legends, classic Anime series, the movie <em>Everything Everywhere All at Once</em>, 80s Hong Kong Gangster films, and, currently, a multigenerational Asian family dramedy.</span></span></span></p> <div>&nbsp;</div> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults &amp; Seniors: $25 | Students: $16</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
