  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/rhs-the-dimes-2025/event_34696_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/rhs-the-dimes-2025/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/IMG_1822-scaled.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g10269460"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/rhs-the-dimes-2025/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "SOLD OUT! | Rehearsal Hall Sessions: The Dimes Christmas Special"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>THE DIMES CHRISTMAS SPECIAL<br /></i><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #ff0000;'>This event is SOLD OUT!</span></span></strong></h4> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='color: #000000;'><span style='color: #000000;'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>ABOUT THE SHOW<br /></strong></span></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Celebrate the magic of the season with <strong>The Dimes</strong> and their spectacular Christmas show! Featuring three powerhouse vocalists, this heartwarming musical experience takes you on a warm musical memory tour of the holiday favourites we all know and love. With breathtaking three-part harmonies, dazzling seasonal costumes, and beautifully choreographed performances, The Dimes bring holiday cheer to audiences of all ages. </span></p> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Get ready to hear timeless Christmas classics from legendary artists like Elvis Presley, Brenda Lee, The Beach Boys, Stevie Wonder, Britney Spears, and more! This show spans over 100 years of holiday music, from the late 1800s to today’s modern hits. Along with the music, The Dimes add interactive fun with fascinating facts about holiday songs, artists, and seasonal traditions, making this an entertaining and engaging experience for the whole family. </span></p> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Whether you’re dreaming of a white Christmas, ready to go walking in a winter wonderland, or craving the cozy nostalgia of Christmas past, this family-friendly show is perfect for audiences from 1 to 92. The Dimes will make you feel like you’re home for the holidays with a joyful celebration of music, history, and festive spirit. Don’t miss this enchanting holiday experience!</p> <p></span></p> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>ABOUT THE ARTISTS</span></strong><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW130972769 BCX0'>The Dimes </span></strong><span class='NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW130972769 BCX0'>cover</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW130972769 BCX0'> the best music from the best decades. Their extensive repertoire means that they truly have something for everyone from the 1950s all the way to </span><span class='NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW130972769 BCX0'>current</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW130972769 BCX0'> day. With 300 songs extending over 8 decades they can perfectly suit any event and the musical tastes of every single guest. The signature trait that makes The Dimes extra special is their inclusion of vintage costumes that fit perfectly in the era of music they sing, as well as choreography for each number that matches the </span><span class='NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW130972769 BCX0'>decades</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW130972769 BCX0'> they are paying tribute to.</span></span></p> <div>&nbsp;</div> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults &amp; Seniors: $25 | Students: $16</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
