  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/theatrix-mean-girls/event_35551_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/theatrix-mean-girls/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Mean-Girls.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g10278780"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/organizer": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g10278820"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/theatrix-mean-girls/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Theatrix: Mean Girls the Musical - High School Version"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'><span style='font-size: 18.6667px;'><b>MEAN GIRLS THE MUSICAL &#8211; HIGH SCHOOL VERSION<br /></b></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'><strong>Presented by Theatrix<br /></strong></span><br /><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>Get in loser—we’re going to the theatre!</span></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Theatrix Youtheatre is bringing the iconic musical <strong>Mean Girls: High School Version</strong> to life with a bold, hilarious, and high-energy cast of young performers. Packed with infectious songs, sharp wit, and all the drama of the high school cafeteria, this production dives headfirst into the wild—and very relatable—social jungle of adolescence.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>When home-schooled newbie Cady Heron arrives at public high school for the first time, she’s quickly swept up by The Plastics—an elite group of girls who rule the school with confidence, control, and colour-coordinated outfits. But popularity has its price. As alliances shift and drama heats up, Cady learns that figuring out who you are matters way more than fitting in.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>With laugh-out-loud moments, big ensemble numbers, and a whole lot of heart, Mean Girls: High School Version is smart, sassy, and ultimately uplifting—a joyful reminder that being real beats being popular. Whether you’re reliving your high school years or surviving them right now, this is one show you won’t want to miss.</span></p> <p><span style='text-decoration: underline;'><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; text-decoration: underline;'>Special Opening Night – Pink Shirt Day</span></strong></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Our opening performance lands on Pink Shirt Day, making it the perfect moment to experience a show that calls out bullying, celebrates individuality, and reminds us that kindness is never out of style. Audiences are encouraged to wear pink and join us in standing up for empathy, inclusion, and being your own person. </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Because on Wednesdays we wear pink… and on opening night, we wear it with purpose.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!<br /></strong>Adults: $25 | Seniors $20 | Children under 12: $15</span></p> <hr> <p><em>This is a rental event organized by Theatrix.</em></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
