        "@value": "<p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'><strong><span style='font-size: 18.6667px;'>JĀN-E JANĀN<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>Presented by the Iranian Instrumental Ensemble Noonavazan<br />In collaboration with the Vancouver Iranian Choir</span></strong></span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>ABOUT THE SHOW</strong></span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>Conductor:</strong> Amir Eslami<br /></span><strong><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>Composers:</span></strong><br /><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>Hossein Dehlavi, Farhad Fakhreddini, Kambiz Roshanravan, Parviz Meshkatian, Hossein Alizadeh. Along with works by ensemble member composers: Farzan Farzaneh, Mohammad Fattahian, Mostafa Ahmadvand, Barbad Bayat, Delaram Zamani, and Donya Dabiri.<br /></span><strong><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>Vocalists:</span></strong><br /><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>Pegah Sherkat, Mohammad Fattahian, Hadi Ansari<br /></span><strong><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>Guest Musicians:</span></strong><br /><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>Hamed Afshari, Saba Jamali, Amin Rezakhani, Paniz Moslehi &amp; Shahin Pourghiasian<br /></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>Project Manager:</strong> Sepehr Hojjaty</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!<br /></strong>All tickets $35</span></p> <hr> <p><em>This is a rental event organized by the Iranian Instrumental Ensemble Noonavazan.</em></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
