        "@value": "<h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 18.6667px;'>SUSTAINABLE STYLE: UPCYCLED FASHION FOR ADULTS<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>with Educator Cyd Eva<br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>Looking for our youth class? <span style='text-decoration: underline;'><a href='https://evergreenculturalcentre.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SOK000006mG3q2AE'><span style='color: #008000; text-decoration: underline;'>Click here!</span></a></span></strong></span><br /></span></b></span></span></h4> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Explore the art of sustainable style in this hands-on, artist-led workshop designed for adults. Transform pre-loved clothing into unique, wearable pieces while learning practical fashion techniques—from basic sewing and hand stitching to embroidery, fabric painting, and embellishment.</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Whether you’re new to sewing or looking to refine your skills, you’ll receive expert guidance as you bring your own creative fashion ideas to life. A curated selection of second-hand garments will be provided, and participants are welcome to bring a few pieces of their own to reinvent.</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Two sewing machines and a serger will be available during class, with the option to bring your personal machine for additional practice.</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Perfect for anyone interested in personal style, sustainable design, and hands-on creativity, this workshop combines practical skill-building with artistic expression—walk away with custom garments you’ll love to wear and the confidence to continue creating on your own.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>CLASS INFORMATION | 2 Sessions Available!</p> <p></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Tuesday Evenings, January 20 &#8211; February 10 | 6:45 &#8211; 8:45PM<br /></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>$175/person<br />Age 18+<br /></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Tuesday Evenings, April 14 &#8211; May 5 | 6:45 &#8211; 8:45PM<br /></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>$175/person<br />Age 18+</span></p> <hr> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong><br />ABOUT OUR EDUCATOR</p> <p></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Cyd Eva is a queer visual artist, fashion designer, face painter, teacher, dancer, and installation artist based in Coquitlam, BC. She holds a BFA in Visual Art from Simon Fraser University, a Fashion Design degree from Cape Town College of Fashion Design, and has trained in surface pattern design, creative entrepreneurship, and pattern drafting.</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>REGISTER ONLINE OR AT THE BOX OFFICE:</strong><br /></span></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong> 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
