  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/same-same-different/event_34681_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/same-same-different/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Tangled-Myrtles.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g10523720"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/same-same-different/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Same Same Different"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>SAME SAME DIFFERENT<br /></i>The Myrtle Sisters<br /></span></strong></h4> <div class='ewa-rteLine'> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>ABOUT THE SHOW</span></strong><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>The Myrtle Sisters had always dressed, sang, danced, talked and even ate the same. They could hardly tell themselves apart until one day through a hilarious and unexpected series of calamities their secret uniqueness was revealed! </span></p> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Can they keep these oddities from one another? Will they still be part of the trio if their differences are discovered?&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong><i>Same Same Different </i></strong>is a three part harmony, tap and swing dance spectacle about self-expression and celebration of differences. </span></p> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Through original and historic live music and dance, The Myrtle Sisters embrace their individuality and learn to work together. Expect plenty of charm, shenanigans, surprises and mishaps in this outrageously fun and insightful experience.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Come along for this silly, heartfelt, musical journey where we discover we can be our unique selves and still belong.&nbsp;</span></p> </div> <div>&nbsp;</div> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>ABOUT THE ARTISTS</span></strong><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span class='TextRun SCXW179579398 BCX0' lang='EN-US' xml:lang='EN-US' data-contrast='auto'><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW179579398 BCX0'><strong>The Myrtle Sisters</strong>, featuring <strong>Candice Roberts</strong>, <strong>Nayana </strong></span><strong><span class='NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW179579398 BCX0'>Fielkov</span></strong><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW179579398 BCX0'>, and <strong>Kat Single-Dain</strong>, are a trio of east Vancouver performers delighting audiences of all ages with their harmonies, twinkling-tap </span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW179579398 BCX0'>numbers</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW179579398 BCX0'> and family antics! </span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW179579398 BCX0'>They’ve</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW179579398 BCX0'> been </span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW179579398 BCX0'>showcasing</span> <span class='NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW179579398 BCX0'>a clowning</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW179579398 BCX0'>, </span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW179579398 BCX0'>vaudeville</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW179579398 BCX0'> and dance menagerie of musical calamity for over 10 years in a variety of venues. Expect plenty of charm and shenanigans along with their original and historic songs and dances. The music stands on its own, but their onstage family antics, tap </span><span class='NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW179579398 BCX0'>s</span><span class='NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW179579398 BCX0'>tylings</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW179579398 BCX0'> and wild tunes are not to be missed.</span></span><span class='EOP SCXW179579398 BCX0' data-ccp-props='{}'>&nbsp;</span></span></p> <div class='ewa-rteLine'>&nbsp;</div> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>All tickets just $15, pay-more-if-you-can!</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
