        "@value": "<p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'><strong><span style='font-size: 14pt;'>MUSIC WITHOUT BORDERS SYMPHONY: BRIDGING EAT AND WEST<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>Presented by the Tri-Cities Chinese Community Society</span></strong></span></p> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>ABOUT THE SHOW<br /></span></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Enjoy <em>Music Without Borders Symphony: Bridging East and West</em>, coming to Evergreen February 20, 2026.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!<br /></strong>All tickets $25.</span></p> <hr> <p><em>This is a rental event organized by the Tri-Cities Chinese Community Society.</em></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
