        "@value": "Coquitlam Adventure Show"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'><strong><span style='font-size: 12pt;'><span style='font-size: 14pt;'>COQUITLAM ADVENTURE SHOW<br /></span>Presented by the Vancouver International Mountain Film Festival</span></strong></span></p> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>ABOUT THE SHOW<br /></span></strong><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='font-weight: 400;'>A wide-ranging collection of films exploring identity, risk, resilience, and life in the mountains. Spanning freeride, alpinism, expedition travel, and personal storytelling, these films move between history, home, loss, creativity, and long-held dreams. Together, they reflect the many ways people navigate challenge, find meaning, and remain deeply connected to the mountain landscapes that shape their lives. </p> <p><strong>ABOUT THE VANCOUVER INTERNATIONAL MOUNTAIN FILM FESTIVAL<br /></strong></span></span></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='font-weight: 400;'>The VIMFF connects our global outdoor community with international filmmakers, creators and speakers, so that we can inspire, entertain and bring mountain adventure into the homes of our viewers. We offer mountain film screenings, live multimedia presentations, photography exhibitions, workshops, seminars &amp; other special events. We invite you to join us throughout the year, as we continue to celebrate and embrace mountain film and culture, outdoor sports and environmental initiatives.</span></span><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='font-weight: 400;'><strong></p> <p></strong></span></span></strong></p> <p><strong style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!<br /></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adult: $32 | Senior &amp; Student: $30</span></p> <hr> <p><em>This is a rental event organized by VIMFF.</em></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
