  },
  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/soul-mom-talks/event_35595_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/soul-mom-talks/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Soul-Mom-Talks-Poster-Post-2-scaled.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g10693120"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/soul-mom-talks/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Soul Mom Talks"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'><strong><span style='font-size: 12pt;'><span style='font-size: 14pt;'>SOUL MOM TALKS<br /></span>Presented by Be Light to Raise Light</span></strong></span></p> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>ABOUT THE SHOW<br /></span></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>Soul Mom Talks</strong>&nbsp;is an evening where mothers step into the spotlight, not to perform perfection, but to speak truth.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Motherhood can feel like carrying the world while quietly holding yourself together. This night is an invitation to pause, breathe, and be seen. To sit among people who understand the depth, devotion, joy, grief, laughter, exhaustion, and sacred power that lives inside caregiving and love.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>On this stage, moms share raw storytelling and soul-level truth, the moments we don’t always say out loud, and the wisdom we earn through loving deeply. These talks are honest, moving, and profoundly human, reminding us that none of us are alone.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>This gathering is for&nbsp;<strong>moms of all kinds</strong>, and for those who walk alongside them,&nbsp;<strong>partners, friends, chosen family</strong>, women who wish to become mothers, women who nurture others in visible and invisible ways, and anyone who feels called to witness the courage and beauty of these stories. If you have ever loved deeply, held space for another, or carried care in your heart, this night is for you.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Come to be moved. </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Come to remember your strength. </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Come to rise, together.</span></p> <div> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>&#x2728;&nbsp;<strong>Moms Take the Stage</strong></span><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>&#x1f4c5;&nbsp;<strong>February 8, 2026</strong></span><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>&#x1f4cd; Evergreen Cultural Centre, Coquitlam</span><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>&#x23f0; Doors open at 3:30 PM | Event 4:00–7:00 PM</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>An unforgettable evening of connection, courage, and collective light.</span></p> </div> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!<br /></strong>All tickets $67.55.</span></p> <hr> <p><em>This is a rental event organized by Be Light to Raise Light.</em></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
