        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/theatre-studio-creations-camp/var/ri-1.l-L1"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "SOLD OUT | Theatre &amp; Studio Creations Camp"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 18.6667px;'><span style='color: #ff0000;'>SOLD OUT |</span> THE ART OF PERFORMANCE: THEATRE &amp; STUDIO CREATIONS CAMP<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>MARCH 23-27, 2026 | 9AM &#8211; 4PM | $325 </span></b><span style='font-size: 12pt;'><em><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'>(i</span></em></span><em><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>ncludes tickets to 2 theatre shows and 2 theatre performer workshops)<br /></span></em></span><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>AGE 8 &#8211; 13</p> <p><span style='color: #ff0000;'>This camp is SOLD OUT! Please join our waitlist or go back to explore other camp options.</span></span></b></span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Get ready for a week bursting with creativity, imagination, and hands-on artmaking! Campers will experience the best of both worlds—performing and visual arts—through a mix of theatre, movement, and studio art projects inspired by live performances.</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Throughout the week, campers will watch two incredible professional theatre shows—<strong>The Trollsons</strong> on Tuesday and <strong>Mike Battie</strong> on Thursday—and take part in exclusive, interactive workshops led by the performers themselves. Between shows, they’ll dive into the visual arts studio to create imaginative artworks inspired by the performances—exploring painting, collage, sculpture, and mixed-media techniques that bring the magic of theatre to life.</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Join us for an extraordinary week where art meets performance, creativity takes center stage, and every camper has a chance to shine!</span></p> <p><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>EVERGREEN BOX OFFICE: 604-927-6555</b>&nbsp;</span><br /><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Open Monday – Friday | 12 – 5pm</p> <p></b></span></p> <hr> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div><span style='font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;'><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'>Refund/Withdrawal Policy&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></span></div> <div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>All withdrawals and refund requests must be made 14 days prior to the program start date. </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Withdrawals and refund requests made within 14 days of the program start date may not be eligible for a full refund.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>*Exceptions for medical or compassionate reasons may be considered upon receipt of a written request submitted at least 24 hours prior to the start date of the camp to&nbsp; <span style='color: #339966;'><u><a id='OWAfc9bdbf3-3e41-5310-9014-3dcbfc543b57' class='x_OWAAutoLink' style='color: #339966;' title='mailto:tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' href='mailto:tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' data-linkindex='0' data-outlook-id='a03e9593-efca-44b3-b530-e4f1fc63889e'>tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca</a></u> </span>or <u><a id='OWA6f03482a-574b-781c-add7-6bebcf52aa0b' class='x_OWAAutoLink' style='color: #000000;' title='mailto:boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' href='mailto:boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' data-linkindex='1' data-outlook-id='b635d444-62d6-4bce-bb9c-184d7abbf40b'><span style='color: #339966;'>boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca</span></a></u>. A medical certificate may be required. Upon approval, a refund of the class fee will be granted.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
