        "@id": "_:g10832940"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/fashion-half-day-camp/var/ri-3.l-L1"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "SOLD OUT | Fashion, Fabric &amp; Patterns Half-Day Camp"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><b><span style='font-size: 14pt;'><span style='color: #ff0000;'>SOLD OUT |</span> FASHION, FABRIC &amp; PATTERNS HALF DAY CAMP<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>MARCH 23 &#8211; 27, 2026 | 1:30PM &#8211; 5PM | $200<br />AGE 8 &#8211; 13</span></b></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #ff0000;'><b>This camp is SOLD OUT! Please join our waitlist or go back to explore other camp options.</b></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Step into the world of fashion and design with artist and designer Cyd Eva! In this creative camp, you’ll explore color, texture, and pattern while learning expressive techniques like embroidery, mending, and embellishment. Transform pre-loved clothing—hoodies, sweaters, or jackets—into wearable art using beads, rhinestones, patchwork, and floral designs. You’ll also experiment with pattern illustration, color palettes, and motif creation through painting, embroidery, and collage. Celebrate your unique style as you reimagine textiles and home décor with playful, hands-on techniques!</span></p> <p><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>EVERGREEN BOX OFFICE: 604-927-6555</b>&nbsp;</span><br /><span style='font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><b>Open Monday – Friday | 12 – 5pm</p> <p></b></span></p> <hr> <div>&nbsp;</div> <p><span style='font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;'><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'>Refund/Withdrawal Policy&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>All withdrawals and refund requests must be made 14 days prior to the program start date. </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Withdrawals and refund requests made within 14 days of the program start date may not be eligible for a full refund.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>*Exceptions for medical or compassionate reasons may be considered upon receipt of a written request submitted at least 24 hours prior to the start date of the camp to&nbsp; <span style='color: #339966;'><u><a id='OWAfc9bdbf3-3e41-5310-9014-3dcbfc543b57' class='x_OWAAutoLink' style='color: #339966;' title='mailto:tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' href='mailto:tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' data-linkindex='0' data-outlook-id='a03e9593-efca-44b3-b530-e4f1fc63889e'>tatiana@evergreenculturalcentre.ca</a></u> </span>or <u><a id='OWA6f03482a-574b-781c-add7-6bebcf52aa0b' class='x_OWAAutoLink' style='color: #000000;' title='mailto:boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' href='mailto:boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca' data-linkindex='1' data-outlook-id='b635d444-62d6-4bce-bb9c-184d7abbf40b'><span style='color: #339966;'>boxoffice@evergreenculturalcentre.ca</span></a></u>. A medical certificate may be required. Upon approval, a refund of the class fee will be granted.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
