        "@value": "DanceForce Company Preview Show 2026"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'><strong><span style='font-size: 14pt;'>DANCEFORCE COMPANY PREVIEW SHOW 2026<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>Presented by DanceForce</span></strong></span></p> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>ABOUT THE SHOW<br /></span></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Join DanceForce Company for an exciting evening showcasing brand-new competitive choreography for the 2026 season. This special preview highlights the dedication, artistry, and passion of our dancers as they prepare for the upcoming competition year. An inspiring celebration of hard work, growth, and performance</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!<br /></strong>All tickets $25, limit 2 per person</span></p> <hr> <p><em>This is a rental event organized by DanceForce.</em></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
