  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/tina-leon/event_34650_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/tina-leon/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/IMG_0608-1-scaled.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g10926900"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/tina-leon/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Tina Leon"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>TINA LEON&nbsp;</i><br /></span></strong></h4> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>Tina Leon</strong> is a singer and songwriter from Montreal who draws her inspiration from the Motown Generation and the soul music of the last decades. Having already sung and collaborated with Stevie Wonder, DJ Champion, Daniel Bélanger and Les Louanges under the artist name of Marie-Christine Depestre, she now appears in a new light, more authentic and full of life than ever. In reference to the nickname given to her by her family and in homage to her maternal grandmother, this choice of a new stage name is a way for her to fully express her personality, to assert her art and thus to find a form of balance.</span></p> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Describing it as a rainbow of soul, her debut album “Push &amp; Pull” which came out on May 16, 2025, is a colourful journey through jazzy, funk, and pop rhythms with rich and enchanting melodies.</span></p> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>The deep feeling that Leon pours into her music, accompanied by the bright, complex variety of sound, makes this album burst open with a colourful array of emotion.</span><b></b></p> <div class='ewa-rteLine'>&nbsp;</div> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults: $43 | Seniors: $39 | Students: $16</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
