  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/the-golden-anniversaries/event_34448_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/the-golden-anniversaries/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Screenshot-2025-04-23-at-2.37.43 PM.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g11047540"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/the-golden-anniversaries/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Golden Anniversaries"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;'><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>THE GOLDEN ANNIVERSARIES<br /></i><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>An Arts Club Theatre Company Production</span><br /></span></strong></span><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><i></i>By Mark Crawfrord</span><br /></span></strong></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>Since they got married, Glen and Sandy Golden have celebrated every wedding anniversary by coming to the same cottage for a romantic getaway. This weekend marks a major milestone: 50 years of wedded bliss. Well, mostly bliss&#8230;. A week ago, Sandy cancelled their big anniversary party and kicked Glen to the curb. Now, he wants to talk. </span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>Join the Goldens as they recount the good, the bad, and the ugly of spending half a century together. From the writer of Bed and Breakfast and The Birds and the Bees, The Golden Anniversaries is a funny, tender comedy-drama about the kind of love that endures—even when it’s tested by time, change, and the realities of growing older together.</span></p> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults: $54 | Seniors: $46 | Students: $16 | Row A: $29</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
