  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/badass-babes-badass-ball/event_35646_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/badass-babes-badass-ball/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Bad-Ass-Ball.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g11094400"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/organizer": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g11094440"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/badass-babes-badass-ball/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Badass Babes: The Badass Ball – 10 Year Anniversary"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><strong><span style='font-size: 18.6667px;'><i>THE BADASS BALL – 10 YEAR ANNIVERSARY<br /></i></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>Badass Babes Dance</span></strong></span></span></p> <p><span class='elementToProof' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>For one night only, the doors open to a world where elegance meets edge… and power wears heels.</span></p> <p><span class='elementToProof' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Step into&nbsp;<b>The Badass Ball</b>, a decadent masquerade ball celebrating 10 years of Badass Babes Dance — a decade of confidence built, fears shattered, and women stepping unapologetically into themselves.</span></p> <p><span class='elementToProof' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>This is not just a dance show. </span><span class='elementToProof' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>It is a tantalizing immersive experience.</span></p> <p><span class='elementToProof' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>You will be brought into a world of the many characters you might encounter at a grand ball — the mysterious, the playful, the dramatic, the seductive — all reimagined with the unmistakable Badass Babes edge. </span><span class='elementToProof' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Through multiple styles of dance — fun, sexy, intense, elegant and everything in between — each performance reveals a different story. </span><span class='elementToProof' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>High-energy commercial choreography, sultry heels, theatrical moments, and unexpected surprises invite you into a night of connection and transformation.</span></p> <p><span class='elementToProof' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>And if you’re lucky… you may find yourself part of the experience.</span></p> <p><span class='elementToProof' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Champagne energy. </span><span class='elementToProof' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Cabaret temptation. </span><span class='elementToProof' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Unfiltered confidence.</span></p> <p><span class='elementToProof' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>For 10 years, this community has been about more than dance — it has been about courage, growth, and claiming space in a world that often asks women to shrink.</span></p> <p><span class='elementToProof' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Tonight, we don’t shrink. </span><span class='elementToProof' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Tonight, we celebrate. </span><span class='elementToProof' style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Dress to impress, throw on a mask, and join us at the Ball!</span></p> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>ABOUT BADASS BABES DANCE<br /></span></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Badass Babes Dance is an all-adult dance training company dedicated to empowering, inspiring, and educating dancers of every skill level, body type, and background. Built on a foundation of inclusivity and support, we create a safe space where women can grow physically, mentally, and emotionally. Our high-energy classes and performances are designed to uplift and unite—celebrating the joy of movement while making a meaningful impact. Through our showcases, we dance with purpose—raising funds, building community, and welcoming YOU to join the experience!</span></p> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE:</strong><br />$30-$50 | 19+ Event<br />Badass Babes Apparel pre-order available.<br /></span></span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><em>This is a rental event organized by Badass Babes Dance.</em></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
