        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A VIBRANT COLLECTION OF LIVE MUSICOur Music Series features a wide variety of contemporary folk, roots &amp; blues, classical repertoires, and sensational voices from established Canadian and international musicians. Generously sponsored by TD Bank. If you have accessibility needs or questions about our venue, please contact our Box Office"
