        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "THE COOLEST EVENTS IN TOWNThis series of exciting performances expands our season of events into our black box Rehearsal Hall! Come experience comedy, theatre, music &amp; more in an intimate setting, featuring emerging artists and diverse voices. Rehearsal Hall Sessions are General Admission seating. Have access needs or questions?"
