  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/summer-events/event_34466_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/summer-comedy-weekend-comedy-department/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/PANTS-ON-FIRE-EVERGREEN.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g11819280"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/summer-events/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Summer Comedy Weekend: The Comedy Department - Pants On Fire!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;'><strong>THE COMEDY DEPARTMENT: PANTS ON FIRE!<br />Summer Comedy Weekend</p> <p></strong></span></div> <div> <div class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><em>Pants on Fire</em> is an exciting mash up of <em>The Liars Club Game Show</em> and <em>Whose Line Is It Anyway?</em> This non-stop laughs comedy show explores the fascinating world of the lies we tell. Think you can spot a liar? Come find out! Each night, a different member of the audience (or surprise celebrity guest!) is invited onstage to tell some truths but mostly lies and fool everyone in the process. These lies could range from little white lies to larger than life deceptions that may have shaped history! The performers are left to sort fact from fiction, catch the liar and spin all the tall tales into comedy gold. Get your laugh on as we crown our guests Honest Humans OR Master Deceivers!</span></div> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><em>Pants on Fire</em> is a raucous comedy romp reminding us that sometimes the most captivating stories are born out of the lies we tell. The truth is funny, but the lies are hilarious.</span></div> <div>&nbsp;</div> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ABOUT THE COMEDY DEPARTMENT</strong></span></div> <div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='color: #008000;'><a style='color: #008000;' href='https://www.thecomedydepartment.com/'>The Comedy Department</a></span> is Vancouver&#8217;s newest destination for comedy! Canadian Comedy Award-winning performers, <strong>Denise Jones</strong> and <strong>David Milchard</strong> have established a world-class special event and corporate custom comedy company. Also offering weekly live shows downtown, The Comedy Department is TOP RATED on TripAdvisor. Working with some of the best improvisers in North America, The Comedy Department is guaranteed to bring the laughs to any event! There is a very good chance you’ve seen them on Netflix, Amazon Prime, Disney+, CW, ABC, NBC, CBS, CBC, CRAVE and more. Maybe you’ve seen one of their regular performers on YouTube’s <em>Convos With My 2-Year-Old</em> (125+ million views)! Their performers have toured across North America, Australia and The Caribbean. They’ve also performed at comedy festivals such as: Just For Laughs, BumberShoot, Edmonton’s Improvaganza, and the Chicago, Seattle, Miami, Vancouver and San Francisco Improv festivals.</p> <p></span></div> <hr> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!<br /></strong>Adults: $42 | Seniors: $38 | Students: $16<br /><em>Purchase tickets to 2 Comedy Weekend events and save 15% off Adult &amp; Senior prices!<br /></em></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555<br /></strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
