  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/summer-events/event_34467_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/summer-comedy-weekend-the-improvisers/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/PCRE-Headshots-scaled.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g11819580"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/summer-events/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Summer Comedy Weekend: The Improvisers"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;'><strong>THE IMPROVISERS<br />Summer Comedy Weekend</strong></span></p> <div> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>THE IMPROVISERS</strong>, some of Canada’s best improvisational comedians, take on your suggestions and create spontaneous comedy sketches right before your eyes. The show is a fun, variety filled, high energy comedy experience with performers who have been seen on CBC’s JUST FOR LAUGHS, CTV’s COMEDY INC, NBC’s LATE FRIDAY, CBC’s WINNIPEG COMEDY FESTIVAL, CTV’s COMEDY NOW, CBC’s HALIFAX COMEDY FESTIVAL and many more.</span></p> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ROMAN DANYLO |</strong>&nbsp; Roman has appeared on CTV’s Comedy Now, Comedy Inc. and Corner Gas. CBC’s Just For Laughs, The Debaters, Winnipeg, Halifax Comedy Festivals and is the creator of The Comic Strippers.</span></p> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>CHRIS CASSILAN |</strong> An actor and improviser based in Vancouver BC. Currently, he is touring with the The Comic Strippers show, where he is an original contributor and performer. He is a two time Canadian Comedy Awards winner with various tv credits such as NBC’s Trial &amp; Error, Phantom Pups, Super Pups, Puppy Pep and film credits Been Better, Actually (Short 2023), Kingsway (2018). Catch him in his new improvised musical show, TROUBADOUR, coming soon.</span></p> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>PEARCE VISSER |</strong> Pearce is an actor/improviser/writer/emcee/entertainer based in Vancouver with over 35 years professional experience. He has earned a spot in Cirque du Soleil’s actor talent pool, entertained on cruise ships, and performed in 100&#8217;s of corporate events.</span></p> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ELLIE HARVIE |</strong> As an Improv comedian Ellie won the Just for Laughs Improv Tournament championship held in Montreal, beating competitors from across the world. And received a Gold medal in CBC&#8217;s Improv Olympics. An accomplished actress, with over 180 credits. Recent works include Good Doctor, Snowpiercer and Virgin River.</span></p> <p class='ewa-rteLine'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Don’t miss this chance to see some of these award winning comedians on tour near you!</p> <p></span></p> </div> <hr> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!<br /></strong>Adults: $42 | Seniors: $38 | Students: $16<br /><em>Purchase tickets to 2 Comedy Weekend events and save 15% off Adult &amp; Senior prices!<br /></em></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555<br /></strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
