        "@value": "SUMMER IS OFFICIALLY HERE!Welcome back to long evenings in the sun at Lafarge Lake, and a new line up of sizzling summer events at Evergreen! From our art studios to our main performance spaces, our venue is bursting with seasonal events. Enjoy a refreshing new set of Cocktail Concerts,"
