  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/event-location/rehearsal-hall/event_35611_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/mollys-comedy-cabaret-2026/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Mollys-Comedy-Cabaret.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g13604220"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/event-location/rehearsal-hall/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Molly’s Comedy Cabaret"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'><strong><span style='font-size: 18.6667px;'>MOLLY&#8217;S COMEDY CABARET<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>Presented by Molly Wilson</span></strong></span></p> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>ABOUT THE SHOW<br /></span></strong><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='font-weight: 400;'>A hilarious musical comedy cocktail of pop, rock, and Broadway favourites—served with a splash of camp and a whole lot of charm. Featuring powerhouse vocals, cheeky storytelling, and big laugh-out-loud moments, Molly’s Comedy Cabaret is the perfect night out for music lovers who like their hits with a twist.</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><span style='font-weight: 400;'><br /><strong>ABOUT MOLLY WILSON<br /></strong></span></span></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>Molly Wilson</strong> is a dynamic actress, singer, entertainer and writer from Vancouver, Canada. Molly tours Molly’s Comedy Cabaret, as well as her two children’s shows Search for the Christmas Penguin and Choose-Your-Own-Adventure – the Musical. An Ovation Award winning performer, Molly has delighted audiences in the UK, US and Canada. She has appeared in numerous plays, musical theatre shows and even been killed in a couple of indie films!</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Molly trained at Grant MacEwan University in Edmonton, Alberta where she earned her Diploma in Theatre Arts. She is an experienced performance coach, specializing in song interpretation and performance and she has taught both improv and musical theatre. Molly is an extremely dedicated performer who is very passionate about the work she creates and very grateful for the opportunity to perform.</span></p> <p><strong style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>SINGLE TICKETS ON SALE!<br /></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>All tickets $42!</p> <p><strong>VIP Ticket (LIMITED AVAILABILITY)</strong><br />Want the full sparkle treatment? The $52 VIP Ticket gets you front-and-centre seats, a little thank-you surprise, and a photo with Molly after the show. Come early, dress fabulous, and soak up the spotlight!<br /></span></p> <hr> <p><em>This is a rental event organized by Molly&#8217;s Comedy Cabaret.</em></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
