        "@value": "Salsa &amp; Latin Dance Lessons"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'><strong><span style='font-size: 14pt;'>SALSA &amp; LATIN DANCE LESSONS<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>Presented by Salsa Dance Zone</span></strong></span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>CLASS OPTIONS</p> <p></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>Salsa dancing for Absolute Beginners</strong> (Thu &#8211; 7 pm)<br /><strong>Salsa Intermediate</strong> (Wed &amp; Thu &#8211; 8 pm)<br /><strong>Salsa Advanced</strong> (Thu &#8211; 9 pm) lessons.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>6 Week courses / 1 hour per week:</span><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>On Wednesdays (7 pm &amp; 9 pm) seasonal Latin dances such as Bachata Dominicana, Bachata Moderna, Merengue, Cumbia, Cha-cha-cha, </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Rueda de Casino &amp; Salsa Solo Shines.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>REGISTRATION ON NOW!<br /></strong>Regular Rates (6 week courses &#8211; 1 hour per week):</span><br /><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Singles $99 / Couples $180</span></p> <div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Students &amp; Seniors Rates (6 week courses &#8211; 1 hour per week):</span></div> <div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Singles $95 / Couples $170</span></div> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div><span style='font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'><span style='font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;'><strong>ABOUT SALSA DANCE ZONE<br /></strong></span></span></p> <div><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Dance Instructors, cultural promotion, events of Salsa, Bachata, Merengue, Cha-cha-cha, Cumbia &amp; Latin American dances. Serving Coquitlam &amp; Tri-Cities &amp; the Lower Mainland since 2008.</span></div> </div> <hr> <p><em>This is a rental event organized by Salsa Dance Zone.</em></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
