    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 18.6667px;'>INTRO TO FLAMENCO<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>with Jhoely Triana</span></b></span></span></h4> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Step into the passionate world of flamenco! This beginner-friendly class is perfect for anyone curious about this expressive Spanish art form, no dance experience needed. In this easy-to-follow series, you’ll explore the essential elements that make flamenco so captivating, including graceful arm and hand movements, rhythmic hand clapping, expressive body language, and gentle, low-impact footwork. Along the way, you’ll also learn about the music, culture, and emotion that bring this art form to life. Taught by a professional dancer!</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Want to see flamenco in action before you dance? Join us for a live Flamenco Show at Evergreen Cultural Centre on March 28th—the perfect inspiration to get you moving!</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>CLASS INFORMATION | 2 Sessions Available!</p> <p></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Sunday Evenings, April 12 &#8211; 26 | 5 &#8211; 7PM<br /></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>$85/person<br />Age 14+</span></p> <hr> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong><br />ABOUT OUR EDUCATOR</p> <p></strong>Jhoely Triana&nbsp;is a Colombian-born flamenco dancer and choreographer based in Vancouver. With a diverse dance background, Jhoely trained at the Goh Ballet Academy, earned a Bachelor of Fine Arts in Contemporary Dance from Simon Fraser University, and honed her flamenco skills at Al Mozaico Flamenco and Flamenco Rosario.</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>REGISTER ONLINE OR AT THE BOX OFFICE:</strong><br /></span></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong> 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
