    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/rhs-paranorma-pi/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/PARANORMAPI_Photo1_2025-scaled.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "_:g15343280"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/2019-20-entertain/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Rehearsal Hall Sessions: ParaNorma P.I."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><strong><span style='color: #000000;'><i>PARANORMA P.I.<br /></i>Hilary Fillier<br /></span></strong></h4> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ABOUT THE SHOW<br /></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>She solves crimes. She Summons Demons. She Strips like the Devil’s watching. </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Meet ParaNorma: part private investigator, part paranormal medium, part hot horny </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>hellion. Created and performed by the dangerously funny <strong>Hilary Fillier</strong>—whose </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>deliciously unholy antics have already seduced over 53,000 TikTok followers— </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><em><strong>ParaNorma P.I.</strong></em> is part paranormal mystery, part burlesque exorcism, and part horned-</span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>up fever dream.</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Fresh off a trail of seductively spooky success at Fringe Festivals across Canada, this award-winning supernatural solo smash is ready to haunt your funny bone and raise your&#8230; expectations. </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>A full-throttle celebration of fat bodies, fierce femmes, and filthy fun, <em>ParaNorma P.I.</em> is </span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>the campy, creepy, cleavage-forward comedy you’ve been dying for.</span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ABOUT THE ARTIST<br />Hilary Fillier</strong> is a graduate of the University of British Columbia BFA Theatre Program. An actor, writer and producer based in Vancouver, she is passionate about creating work with a focus on body positivity. &nbsp;</span></p> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div>&nbsp;</div> <hr> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>SINGLE TICKETS ON SAL!</strong><br /></span></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Adults &amp; Seniors: $25 | Students: $16</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong>BOX OFFICE: 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
