    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/2019-20-entertain/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Adult Advanced Voice Over Acting"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 18.6667px;'>ADULT ADVANCED VOICE OVER ACTING<br /></span><span style='font-size: 12pt;'>with Pamela Hammond</span><br /></b></span></span></h4> <p class='p1'><span style='text-decoration: underline;'><strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; text-decoration: underline;'>Adult Intro to Voice Over Acting is a prerequisite for this course.</span></strong></span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Explore the exciting world of voice over, from commercials and audiobooks to e-learning and character work. Gain hands-on mic experience, script editing skills, and techniques for sounding natural and engaging. Learn industry essentials like demo requirements, client outreach, invoicing, and home studio setup. Advanced classes build on timing, cold reads, and delivering varied takes for professional work. Ideal for aspiring voice actors or anyone curious to try something new—no singing required!<br /></span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Expand your knowledge of Voice Over Acting and gain further experience to be on your way to a voice over career.&nbsp;Many students take this class just for fun, to break into the v/o industry or&nbsp; just&nbsp; to set up podcasts or videocasts.&nbsp;This course is mostly hands on with some lecturing.&nbsp;In this course you will learn timing. Some commercials and animations are read at a fast pace. Students will read scripts within the allotted time as well as voicing &#8220;cold reads&#8221;.&nbsp;Script Editing-Voicing one script 3 different ways as clients &amp; talent banks require many takes to choose from.&nbsp;The largest v/o markets are based in Chicago, New York and Los Angeles. You will learn various USA pronunciations.&nbsp;</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Students will voice E-Learning, Narration, Jingles (even if you can&#8217;t sing), High Energy delivery, and fast paced scripts as well as character spots.&nbsp;</span></p> <p class='p1'><strong style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>CLASS INFORMATION&nbsp;</p> <p></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Monday Evenings, April 20 &#8211; June 1 (no class May 18) | 6:15 &#8211; 9:15PM<br /></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>$165/person<br />Age 18+</span></p> <hr> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ABOUT OUR EDUCATOR</p> <p></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>In 1998 Pamela got her start in voice acting by chance, voicing a short commercial for Global TV. Since then, she has voiced Internationally for TV &amp; Radio Commercials, Animation&nbsp;&amp; Gaming, Jingles, Narration &amp; Documentaries, Corporate Presentations, E-Learning, Social Media Ads and On Hold Messaging. In addition to voice acting, she has also produced spots with a few co-writing credits.</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>REGISTER ONLINE OR AT THE BOX OFFICE:</strong><br /></span></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong> 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
