  {
    "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/2019-20-entertain/event_35429_1",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/events/adult-improv-narrative-spring-2026/var/ri-1.l-L1"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/5.png"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://evergreenculturalcentre.ca/2019-20-entertain/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Adult Improv &amp; Acting: Narrative Improv"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h4><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='color: #000000;'><b><span style='font-size: 12pt;'><span style='font-size: 14pt;'>ADULT IMPROV &amp; ACTING: NARRATIVE IMPROV</span><br />with Michael Charrois</span><br /></b></span></span></h4> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>This dynamic drama workshop for adults explores the fundamentals of narrative improvisation through collaborative storytelling techniques like accepting, advancing, and overcoming obstacles. Participants will build essential life and performance skills such as teamwork, communication, adaptability, and problem-solving. Led by arts educator Michael Charrois, the workshop includes fun games and exercises to develop characters and narratives without the need for memorization. Students will explore physicality, voice, personality traits, and relationships to bring authentic characters to life. Scenes will incorporate emotional depth, vulnerability, and comedic contrast to enhance audience connection and engagement. The course focuses on narrative improv—a form of spontaneous, longer-form storytelling that blends humor and emotion for rich, memorable performances.</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Join Arts Educator Michael Charrois for an evening of improv and acting focused on the foundational techniques of Narrative Improv. This session will revisit and build upon key concepts introduced in previous classes, offering participants a chance to reinforce and practice their skills through guided exercises and scene work.</span></p> <p class='p1'><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Narrative Improv centers on spontaneous storytelling in a theatrical format, blending both comedic and emotional elements. Unlike short-form or traditional long-form improv, narrative performances are typically longer, allowing for deeper character development and richer exploration of themes, relationships, and emotional arcs. Whether you’re continuing from a previous session or jumping in fresh, this class offers a dynamic space to grow your improv abilities through focused practice and creative play.</span></p> <p class='p1'><strong style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>CLASS INFORMATION&nbsp;</p> <p></strong><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Tuesday Evenings, May 5 &#8211; 19 | 6:30 &#8211; 8:30PM<br /></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>$85/person<br />Age 18+</span></p> <hr> <p><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'><strong>ABOUT OUR EDUCATOR</p> <p></strong></span><span style='font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;'>Michael Charrois is a professional actor (UBCP/Actra and Equity) with over 30 years of teaching experience. He currently teaches Drama classes for the Evergreen, Burnaby&#8217;s Shadbolt Centre Community Programs and has taught Continuing Education classes for the Vancouver School Board.</span></p> <p><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;'><span style='font-size: 16px;'><strong>REGISTER ONLINE OR AT THE BOX OFFICE:</strong><br /></span></span><span style='color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'><strong> 604.927.6555 | Open Monday – Saturday, 12 – 5PM</strong></span></p> <p><!-- wp:pattern {'slug':'ajde_events/blocks'} /--></p> "
      }
    ],
